    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You read the chakra in a room the way most people read posture and tone of voice. As a Sensor you track lurking infiltrators, taste the difference between a real shinobi and a clone, and warn your team before anything gets close. You make a poor brawler but a peerless first-watch.</p>\n<p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 8 + Constitution</p>\n<p><strong>Key Attribute</strong> Wisdom</p>\n<p><strong>Initial Proficiencies</strong> trained in simple weapons and martial weapons, trained in unarmed; trained in light/medium armor and unarmored defense; expert Perception; trained Fortitude, expert Reflex and Will; trained in Survival plus 6 additional skills</p>\n<p><strong>Spellcasting</strong> half chakra caster (capped at lower max rank, fewer slots/rank); spell DCs and attack rolls use Wisdom. Your jutsu favor the <em>detection</em>, <em>scrying</em>, and <em>mental</em> traits.</p>\n<p>At 1st level you gain the shared chakra-core features plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtSensorSpc000]{Sensor Specialization} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtSensorPth000]{Sensor Method}.</p>"
    },
